    "zh": "按依赖顺序读：先看事实（配置、Mod 库、数据表），再看“把勾选变成一次能玩的启动”这条链（激活 → 启动 → 自检），然后是程序之外的东西（要下载的组件、游戏目录本身），最后是运行时外壳（界面调的 js_api、进程入口、可观测性、自维护）。",
    "en": "Read it in dependency order: first the facts (config, the mod library, the data tables), then the chain that turns a selection into a running game (activation → launch → self-check), then everything outside the program (components to download, the game folder itself), and finally the runtime skin (the js_api the UI calls, the shell, telemetry, and self-maintenance)."
